        thingsToDo: `Beyond baseball, Sanford's historic downtown district offers antique shopping, restaurants, and a charming riverwalk along Lake Monroe. Orlando's theme parks are just 30-40 minutes south if you want to add vacation days to your tournament trip. For something different, the Central Florida Zoo and Botanical Gardens is 10 minutes away with affordable admission and enough exhibits to fill a few hours. The West Orange Trail offers biking and walking paths if your player needs active recovery between tournament days. For water adventures, the Wekiva Island park provides kayaking, paddleboarding, and a relaxed beach atmosphere about 20 minutes from the complex. Rainy day backup plans include the Orlando Science Center or iFLY indoor skydiving, both within reasonable driving distance.`,
